---Get pull request creation cap bypass list for a repository
---
---Lists the users that are on the pull request creation cap bypass list for a
---repository. Users on this list can create pull requests regardless of any
---configured pull request creation cap.
---
---Only users with maintainer permissions can view the bypass list.
---
---`GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/interaction-limits/pulls/bypass-list`
---@param input github.interactions.GetPullRequestBypassListForRepoRequest
---@return github.interactions.GetPullRequestBypassListForRepoResponseBodyList? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_pull_request_bypass_list_for_repo(input) end

---Get pull request creation cap for an org
---
---Gets the pull request creation cap configuration for an organization.
---The cap limits the total number of open pull requests a user can have across all public
---repositories in the organization at one time.
---
---Only users with admin access to the organization can view the cap configuration.
---
---`GET /orgs/{org}/interaction-limits/pulls/creation-cap`
---@param input github.interactions.GetPullRequestCreationCapForOrgRequest
---@return github.interactions.GetPullRequestCreationCapForOrgResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_pull_request_creation_cap_for_org(input) end

